{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993620/extras/fb3ef5133b48631a9b8ab977d6b9da0b.poster.avif?t=1759417241\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993620/extras/fb3ef5133b48631a9b8ab977d6b9da0b.webm?t=1759417241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993620/extras/fb3ef5133b48631a9b8ab977d6b9da0b.mp4?t=1759417241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andy decides to leave the hustle and bustle of the city and move to a peaceful environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few months later, holding back a slight sense of nostalgia, he arrives at this trailer park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The busy days of being pushed and urged by someone no longer exist here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this place of rest, however, an unexpected incident occurs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics with an emphasis on atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactions with strange residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short horror experience of about 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump scares</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I want to scold the me of yesterday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3993620/a85406e65fbd516877478591773b6a068facd15a.jpg"},{"name":"It seems like nobody is home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3993620/06b405f220014b497de34af7c012d50ecd76e051.jpg"},{"name":"What a delicious pizza","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcom